  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Scaling up DIME</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Scaling Up DIME strengthens digital and financial infrastructure for township MSMEs in South Africa, with a focus on youth- and women-led enterprises. The project improves enterprise visibility, digital onboarding, finance readiness, alternative credit assessment, and access to inclusive market and financing pathways. By scaling DIME as a township enterprise digital and data backbone, the project supports more resilient, finance-ready, and digitally enabled township economies.</narrative>
  </description>
